<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Reset Your Password - PePP Cruise</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        margin: 50px auto;
        padding: 30px;
        max-width: 600px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(95, 61, 244, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5f3df4, #4c2cc7);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 25px 0;
        border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
        margin: -30px -30px 30px -30px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .brand-name {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 0 10px;
      }
      .content p {
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #4a5568;
        margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #1a202c;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .reset-code-container {
        background-color: #f7fafc;
        border: 2px solid #5f3df4;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .reset-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #5f3df4;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 15px 25px;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
      }
      .reset-button:hover {
        background-color: #4c2cc7;
      }
      .security-notice {
        background-color: #fef5e7;
        border-left: 4px solid #f6ad55;
        padding: 15px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .security-notice p {
        margin: 5px 0;
        color: #744210;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #718096;
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
      .footer .signature {
        color: #5f3df4;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <div class='brand-name'>PePP Cruise</div>
        <h1>🔐 Password Reset OTP</h1>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p class='greeting'>Hello there,</p>

        <p>
          We received a request to reset your password for your PePP Cruise account.
          To proceed with the password reset, please use the OTP code below:
        </p>

        <div class='reset-code-container'>
          <p style='margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #5F3DF4;'>Your Reset Code</p>
          <p style='margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; color: black;'>
            <b>{{otpCode}}</b>
          </p>
          <p style='margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #718096;'>
            Use this code to reset your password
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='security-notice'>
          <p><strong>⏰ Important:</strong>
            This reset code is valid for 10 minutes only.</p>
          <p><strong>🔒 Security:</strong>
            Never share this code with anyone.</p>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email and
          ensure your account is secure. Your password will remain unchanged.
        </p>

        <p>
          For additional security questions or if you need assistance, please
          contact our support team at
          <a
            href='mailto:support@peppcruise.com'
            style='color: #5F3DF4; text-decoration: none;'
          >
            support@peppcruise.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>Best regards,</p>
        <p class='signature'>The PePP Cruise Security Team</p>
        <p style='margin-top: 15px; font-size: 12px;'>
          © 2024 PePP Cruise. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>